{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le12ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le12ob02re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn10le12ob02re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Adam, you're here. You're looking much better this morning.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Hey. Thanks. I'll be feeling much better too after I've had a good night's sleep. Although after having started my research, I don't know when that will be. Have you started doing any legwork for the assignment?<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Research? Why would we have to do legwork? Did you do any? There isn't much accessible information about him online.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I tried. You're right but how else are we supposed to get hold of some information then?", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn10le12ob02re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Well, I'll be having a meeting with the author in a few days. I'll be expecting a reply back today via e-mail or phone telling me which day works for him.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: What do you mean? We can do that? You're telling me this now? After having spent hours last night frantically trying to get the scoop online, when I could have gone to bed?<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I guess. You also should have checked your messages. I texted you about this.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I didn't get any texts from you! You should have just called me.<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I'm sorry. Will I be hearing about this all day long?<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: No no. I just would have preferred to have slept all night rather than reading through those articles.", "id": 2, "time": "28000"}, {"image": "engenn10le12ob02re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I said I was sorry Adam.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I know. I'm just giving you a hard time.<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: It's okay. Anyway, you must have felt overwhelmed.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I was. On that note, is Boris in today?<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: No, he's gone to Chicago.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: He e-mailed me yesterday, said he wanted to speak to me. I'll be thinking about what it could possibly be until he gets back.<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I'm sure it's nothing major.", "id": 3, "time": "64000"}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about an unusual or unique event related to work topics.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can request or report facts about events or actions related to work issues.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about expectations for the future.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " How do you do research for an assignment?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Where do you look?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " Doing research can sometimes take a long time!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": 